{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic","id":1531143,"title":"God(s) Away on Business [MtAw2E Seer Chronicle IC]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-19T15:13:29-08:00","id":1531143,"title":"God(s) Away on Business [MtAw2E Seer Chronicle IC]","content":"This is the In-Character thread for the Chronicle &quot;God(s) Away on Business&quot;. It is for descriptions of scenes and roll playing interactions between characters in the story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T15:53:03-08:00","id":1531147,"title":"","content":"<b>Chapter 1</b><br /> It is the stroke of midnight, January 1st, 2016. The chimes of Big Ben ring out. The sky over London <a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/p03df46m\" target=\"_blank\">lights up with fireworks</a> launched from the river and the Eye of London.<br /> <br /> Boris Johnson is Mayor of London. Elizabeth II is Queen of England, the longest reigning monarch in modern history. David Cameron has been re-elected Prime Minister and promised to hold a referendum on the United Kingdom remaining in the European Union. Two months ago, multiple terrorist attacks in Paris killed 130 people. A massive earthquake recently shook Afghanistan and Pakistan, causing 398 deaths.<br /> <br /> Across the pond, Barack Obama is president of the United States, the first reusable rocket has been launched into earth orbit, and a prominent tech company building an Artificial Intelligence has been founded. No one has heard of SARS-CoV-2, but there is an epidemic of the Zika virus in South America. Rio de Janeiro is planning to host the Summer Olympics in the Summer.<br /> <br /> Several skyscrapers in London are illuminated in blue in honor of UNICEF's pledge to help the children of the Syrian Civil War. The Spire, an elongated pyramid of steal and glass, the tallest building in Western Europe, towers over the city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T17:36:42-08:00","id":1531392,"title":"","content":"Duplicate Post","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 02-24-2024, 10:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T17:36:42-08:00","id":1531393,"title":"","content":"A few days later Mekhaine approaches the Spire. Even from a block away the supernal energy threatens to overwhelm his unseen sense.<br /> <br /> There is a large man in a big coat and hat standing by the door.<br /> &quot;Can't go in there yet sir. Not open to the public yet.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mekhaine explains that he has an appointment and the door man confirms by walkie-talkie. He enters the lobby which has rich carpeting, wood paneling, and magnificent crystal chandeliers in a futuristic style. A bell man shows him to the elevator to go up to the Hotel level, 50 stories up. The elevator is so fast it seems like it adds an extra G. <br /> <br /> The restaurant has a magnificent view of the city, looking down on the Tower Bridge and the Eye, as the sun has begun to set. Magic hour as a photographer might say.<br /> <br /> &quot;Right this way, sir. Mr. Amjad is waiting for you at your table.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T19:03:05-08:00","id":1531400,"title":"","content":"Sitting at her blocky laptop, worn from use, the Mage known to some as Mother Time stared blankly at the lit up screen. Eventually, with a sigh she closed the lid on the device and put it to the side. &quot;Enough of this, I can't waste any more time with useless devices.&quot; If she was going to find the right office she needed to look up the records for the Walworth Estate, she needed something more precise. And nothing was more precise than the Prophet's reckoning.<br /> <br /> She pulled out a map of London, unraveling it across the surface of a conference table in her office. Placing whatever books she had on hand to hold down the corners, she stared at the flat diagram of the city. She pulled out her silver pocket watch, her most precious of tools, and speaking in a tongue few could understand, began to chant. She opened her pocket watch's lid, and then moved it slowly in a pendulum motion. Each motion was accompanied by millimeters of southern movement, the watch passing above every inch of the map, scanning London for where precisely she was needed.<br /> <br /> After almost 10 seconds of chanting and swinging, she was beginning to lose hope on finding the right place. Until-<br /> <br /> -CLINK-<br /> <br /> -the watch's lid closed the moment it passed over a particular office building. Finally, just what she was looking for!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T19:42:00-08:00","id":1531402,"title":"","content":"The office indicated by the ritual is near the cricket pitch in South London. It is an old victorian brick building. Inside there is an elderly man in a suit at the clerk's desk who looks like he has been there since the office was built.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes Madam. Welcome to the housing affairs archives. What can I do for you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T21:06:06-08:00","id":1531408,"title":"","content":"As Alexis makes his way through the Spire and the elevator, crossing over into another Seer's domain, he begins falling into his Shadow Name. The casual steps of the programmer become more brisk, purposeful and precise. His posture improves and body language becomes more professional. He feels more methodical by nature, but still relaxed, like if the programming state of flow had become instinct.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;They were well organized, handling the appointment efficiently, verifying the data on my arrival. Normally businesses getting ready to open are messier, but so far no major hiccups. Its unsurprising, this place radiates power. Whatever is here is worth defending, physical security needs to be on point. I wonder if their digital security is up to par. It will have to wait, checking now would be in poor manners&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Mekhaine admires the elegance of the decor as moves along. Alexis would have stopped to take a picture, but he settles for a compliment.<br /> <br /> &quot;The view itself is worth its own trip&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Panopticon's intelligence is valuable, a reliable source doubly so, perhaps enough to cut a deal. With some luck, Saulin might have heard of the hounds of Walworth.&quot;</i><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T07:07:57-08:00","id":1531425,"title":"","content":"Mekhaine notices one of the servers. She is a young woman and seems nervous and unsure of herself as she is taking orders from customers at another table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-26T16:36:09-08:00","id":1531558,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Since the Spire is still not open for business, it means they are simulating service. They must have a big event planned. Having Mr Amjad supervising must add to the tension, its best I let her focus.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Mekhaine proceeds to the table that was indicated to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T21:31:26-07:00","id":1532420,"title":"","content":"The clerk seemed surprised.<br /> <br /> &quot;You want to do research in the housing archives? Two in one day! We don't normally get this many visitors. There's another woman already in the archive stacks. Sign the visitor book here mame&quot;.<br /> <br /> Briggett notices the name above hers. &quot;Trish Takehashi&quot; in nearly perfect cursive penmanship.<br /> <br /> Briggett goes into the archives where there are rows and rows of dust shelves filled with papers. Some of them are bound and cataloged, but some papers seem to have been piled up in boxes in a disorganized fashion.<br /> <br /> In the back stacks, in a section that seems to contain material from when the Walworth estate was first built, Briggett sees a tall, slim, Asian woman. She is young, and could almost be confused for one of Briggett's senior students where it not for her smart, fashionable outfit. She is reaching for a box on the top shelf then puts it down to begin sorting through it. She looks up and sees Briggett and smiles. She has very striking looks.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello! I didn't expect anyone else back here but myself.&quot; She looks down at herself and notices that she has dust all over, and brushes some off. She straightens up into a formal pose and bows slightly and then offers her hand. &quot;My name is Trish. How do you do? <br /> <br /> Her English is good though maybe a little formal, clearly learned as a second language. Her accent is half way between American and British, and sounds a little bit like an old Hollywood moviestar. It reminds Briggett a little of Audrey Hepburn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T22:28:12-07:00","id":1532754,"title":"","content":"The Mage known as Berith eased into his desk, strewn in papers in an eclectic form of organization between plans, budgets, and correspondences from his colleagues. The Moros closed his eyes, mulling over a number of vectors in which he could explore. While his welcoming to higher knowledge had propelled his career from one of just idle service and into something more active and profitable, the roads were not always the most clear.<br /> <br /> But, Thomas Haytham was Berith, and Berith could put much better use to what Thomas had than he could do alone before. So, first on his docket... was figuring out his next move. Berith, a great Duke of Hell, who knew things and could tell them not only of the Past, and Present, but also the future. He closed his eyes, his mind playing the images of possibility on a reel like film. He followed the mental routes he could take and explored them to ultimately two questions:<br /> <br /> <i> &quot;Who might I speak to, about local projects, that would have information useful to the Ministry?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> And<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;where will this search for useful information take me?&quot; </i>The symbols for finality that lingered naturally to his path now welcomed to the queries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T23:36:51-07:00","id":1532757,"title":"","content":"Berith hears a whisper that sounds like hoary entropy itself and the whimpering death of all things.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> &quot;Thomas Hatham shall go to the Southwark Housing Authority Archives. There he will meet two women, one a servant of the Prophet and one a servant of the Fox Ridder. Together they will discover the one who steals, the one who cheets, the one who kills, and the one who lies. These four must be bent to Thomas Hatham's will if his plans are to succeed. <b>THIS IS THE FUTURE!&quot; </b></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A chill fills the air of Thomas' office, and cup of tea on his desk has frozen solid, a slight crack in the mug indicating the rapid cooling and expansion of the ice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 03-17-2024, 05:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-17T10:59:14-07:00","id":1532772,"title":"","content":"Berith let a low chuckle slip from his lips. Excitement, and apprehension, mingled in the pit of his stomach. The presence of those on high never not unsettled him. Then, well, disappointment slipped into the mix as he took up the cup of tea. Rolling it slowly to inspect its angles. Opening a window, he'd dump the frozen solution out with a <i>plop </i>into the grass below. Thomas resumed as himself, leaving the cup in his office as he left for the day for far more interesting things.<br /> <br /> Berith, now approaching the office building took a moment to peer through the windows and take stock of the applicants. He wore a business friendly smile, and he twisted the ring on his finger for luck before pressing inside. The Prophet's scion, and the servant of the Fox Riddler. Who could they be?<br /> <br /> Quickly, Thomas approached the desk, his hands set flat and gentle on thr top. &quot;Hello, dove,&quot; he greeted pleasantly. &quot;I'm looking to do some research on just a couple of things, and maybe meet with a couple of colleagues here. Sign in and go okay?&quot;<br /> <br /> Already, Thomas' attention was shifting to see who had arrived today while he fished up a pen, his gaze flicking back up with a smile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","user":"VictorOfNyke","date":". 03-17-2024, 06:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-17T15:15:24-07:00","id":1532783,"title":"","content":"Mekhaine sits down in front of Mr. Amjad, who is having afternoon tea. They proceed to the niceties of a business meeting, with it being framed as business proposal from Arkhitekton Security Systems to provide security for the Spire. After the servers have left, he proceeds to transition to Seer business:<br /> <br /> &quot;This is the first time I have visited the Spire, you are overseeing quite the impressive locale Saulin, to radiate such palpable power. I imagine it has drawn a lot of attention from other Awakened, and that it will increase as opening day draws near. Fortunately, I have a proposal that will make managing that easier.<br /> <br /> I deal in one of the most valuable commodities of them all, information, and I have a standing deal with a contact in Panopticon. I keep an eye out on anything, or anyone, they are interested in and they supply me with information in exchange. Given that we are in the city with the most CCTVs in the world, it gives them an impressive well of knowledge. They have also agreed to extend the same deal to you, should you be interested. I believe that your standing in the Roland Property Group can help me in these investigations and my knowledge as a security consultant can aid you in keeping an eye on the Spire, which would allow us both to benefit from a steady stream of information.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-19T17:44:04-07:00","id":1532879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1532420#post1532420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The clerk seemed surprised.<br /> <br /> &quot;You want to do research in the housing archives? Two in one day! We don't normally get this many visitors. There's another woman already in the archive stacks. Sign the visitor book here mame&quot;.<br /> <br /> Briggett notices the name above hers. &quot;Trish Takehashi&quot; in nearly perfect cursive penmanship.<br /> <br /> Briggett goes into the archives where there are rows and rows of dust shelves filled with papers. Some of them are bound and cataloged, but some papers seem to have been piled up in boxes in a disorganized fashion.<br /> <br /> In the back stacks, in a section that seems to contain material from when the Walworth estate was first built, Briggett sees a tall, slim, Asian woman. She is young, and could almost be confused for one of Briggett's senior students where it not for her smart, fashionable outfit. She is reaching for a box on the top shelf then puts it down to begin sorting through it. She looks up and sees Briggett and smiles. She has very striking looks.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello! I didn't expect anyone else back here but myself.&quot; She looks down at herself and notices that she has dust all over, and brushes some off. She straightens up into a formal pose and bows slightly and then offers her hand. &quot;My name is Trish. How do you do?<br /> <br /> Her English is good though maybe a little formal, clearly learned as a second language. Her accent is half way between American and British, and sounds a little bit like an old Hollywood moviestar. It reminds Briggett a little of Audrey Hepburn.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Poorly, I'm afraid. I have too little time to converse, so if you would direct me towards the records regarding the Walworth Estate, that would be preferable. As it stands, I <i>cannot</i> dally any more than I have for today.&quot; The older woman gave the girl a stern stare, conveying just how seriously she needed to access this information. The same stare had caused many a student of hers to quail in fear of further punishment, and this young lady would be no different.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Today</i>, please.&quot; She couldn't afford to be polite at this point. Time was already being wasted, a commodity she was ill-tempted to part with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-20T03:44:21-07:00","id":1532894,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, um...So sorry&quot;. The tall, young Asian woman looks down at her shoes. &quot;I don't work here. I'm a journalist...or er...I'm sort of a journalist. I'm interning at a newspaper while I study at University.&quot; She gives Bridgitte the impression of a &quot;good student&quot; who has been caught doing something naughty.<br /> <br /> &quot;Are you interested in the Walworth Estate too? There was this woman who came to the paper's offices complaining about pests in her building. My editors told me it was a waste of time to look into it, but it peaked my interest.&quot;<br /> <br /> She pointed to a certain section of the stacks. &quot;This section here is all about property maintenance and tenant complaints. Was there a particular subject you were interested in? I might have seen something. I've been here for a few hours. I guess I got obsessed.&quot;<br /> <br /> Bridgitte recognizes the type. She is like a Teacher's Pet, an eager overachiever who wants to please. Maybe Bridgitte sees a little bit of her younger self in this girl. She does get the odd sense of being &quot;read&quot; when the young woman mentions the words &quot;waste of time&quot; and &quot;obsessed&quot;. Unusual for a mere sleeper.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes. We should stay focused. They close up in about an hour, though sometimes they stay open latter if council members or government employees are here.&quot;<br /> <br /> When she says this Mother Time feels her unseen sense prickle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 03-20-2024, 07:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-20T03:57:59-07:00","id":1532895,"title":"","content":"Peering through the windows, Berith notices a young Asian woman sitting at a reading table, looking at some papers like a student who believes in studying as if her life depended on it.<br /> <br /> As he twists his ring and wishes himself good luck, he feels his unseen sense press on his attention. The young woman looks up and smiles at him through the window, and then quickly dives back down into her papers as a short woman in her mid forties approaches with a glowering and determined look. Even though he only glimpsed her face briefly, Thomas is struck by the younger woman's almost otherworldly beauty. She would certainly stand out in a crowd.<br /> <br /> The old gentleman clerk raises an eyebrow at being referred to as &quot;Dove&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;Three in one day! What the duce?&quot; he mutters under his breath.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes. Just there sir. And be sure to include the time. We were about to close, but I suppose with a council member here, we can extend the reading hours.&quot;<br /> <br /> Thomas looks down at the sign-in book. He sees two names, both in very neat and precise hands. &quot;Trish Takehashi&quot;, arrived at 3:03, and &quot;Bridgitte Timothy&quot;, arrived at 6:06. <br /> <br /> He looks at his watch. 7:07. That's a little odd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T09:50:17-07:00","id":1533038,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sorry about that sir,&quot; Thomas replied almost absently. &quot;Bit on a tizzy today it would seem.&quot; As he signed his time, and noted the peculiarities, he'd begin opening his sense for the supernatural. With a bit of extra exertion, a burning of precious mana, he expanded them into the Arcana of Time as well. <br /> <br /> It came to him in a mix and swath of information. First in the symbolic weight and value of each item, as if the Queen of Numbers, or her servant Mammon set the unspoken offer of money upon each one. Then, the granted information of Death, revealing a secret commodity, a source of power in the still existing dead or in the value of souls. Finally, the scale of time that proved value in action as in the continuing shift in what was considered <i>present.</i><br /> <br /> He scanned the room around him first before he began toward the archive space itself, his attention settled on Trish rather curiously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T16:02:37-07:00","id":1533050,"title":"","content":"Berith, tall and wearing an expression somewhere between bemused curiosity and faintly balanced between gregarious and dour. There is a moment's pause, perhaps <i>more</i> noticeable to one with <i>The Gift of Sight, </i> the circumstances were so...strangely aligned that it almost felt like it was divinely mandated. He twisted his ring once more, as if adjusting it to a place more comfortable on his finger. <br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe I can intrude on you two ladies,&quot; Berith's voice settled low, almost conspiratorial. &quot;and borrow just a little bit of Time from the both of you. I think its a delightful providence that I happen to run into you both here. Care to chat?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T19:16:26-07:00","id":1533059,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh! Hello. I saw you in the window. I was hoping you would come in.&quot; Trish says in a breathy whisper. Her accent is a little hard to place, but her English is fluent.<br /> <br /> She gets up and offers her hand. &quot;Trish Takehashi&quot;.<br /> She looks up appreciatively at Thomas, and does that weird slouch that some tall women do to appear &quot;cuter&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't mind. But...um..&quot; she looks over at the older woman as she approaches, &quot; We are kind of busy and the archives are about to close.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T20:03:15-07:00","id":1533060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1532783#post1532783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;This is the first time I have visited the Spire, you are overseeing quite the impressive locale Saulin, to radiate such palpable power. I imagine it has drawn a lot of attention from other Awakened, and that it will increase as opening day draws near. Fortunately, I have a proposal that will make managing that easier.<br /> <br /> I deal in one of the most valuable commodities of them all, information, and I have a standing deal with a contact in Panopticon. I keep an eye out on anything, or anyone, they are interested in and they supply me with information in exchange. Given that we are in the city with the most CCTVs in the world, it gives them an impressive well of knowledge. They have also agreed to extend the same deal to you, should you be interested. I believe that your standing in the Roland Property Group can help me in these investigations and my knowledge as a security consultant can aid you in keeping an eye on the Spire, which would allow us both to benefit from a steady stream of information.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Saulin minutely cocks an impeccably trimmed eyebrow. &quot;Well, now,&quot; he begins, his voice as smooth as Turkish coffee, &quot;this is quite a deal. You're offering me the proverbial keys to the kingdom and all you want in exchange is a mere investigative leg up? As we tend to say in our circles, that's quite the trade imbalance.&quot;<br /> <br /> Saulin takes a slow, deep sip from his tea and leans back just a hair in his seat. &quot;Why don't we start by you telling me what you are hoping to accomplish and how you think <i>we</i> can help you.&quot; The inflection Saulin puts on &quot;we&quot; causes Mekhaine to wonder if he was referring to the Roland Group or himself in the royal first-person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-28T17:13:24-07:00","id":1533339,"title":"","content":"&quot;My client has found people of interest who are pushing against the limits of the Lie. They could be potential assets for the Throne. But they are in places that can be difficult to monitor, such as the Walford Estate and the Spire.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mekhaine savors a smoked salmon tea sandwich, a popular variation in Hong Kong tea culture, probably chosen to welcome visiting investors.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;It would be impractical for him to bypass the middleman, my contact's network security is easily beyond ISO 27001 standards, not to mention they use use software developed in-house and Supernal defenses. &quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I believe a joint venture would make it easier to evaluate their potential, aid Panopticon in filtering which prospects to prioritize. After all, Awakenings are as hard to predict as they are messy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mekhaine takes a long sip of the tea.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Which means it could happen during the Spire's grand opening.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;For my part, I stand to gain leads into promising magical technologies. I will use them to reinforce my network, which in turn will be able to gather more valuable information. In the end, its just good business&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-28-2024, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-05T19:29:10-07:00","id":1533678,"title":"","content":"Saulin smiles broadly. &quot;I like the way you think. I also appreciate your candor. So, are you looking to access our security feeds or place some agents on our staff? What exactly is the nature of the desired assistance?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T15:44:25-07:00","id":1533909,"title":"","content":"&quot;Access to the security feeds would be the key one, I also have software ready to parse through emails and camera feeds. An employee living in the Walworth Council Estates seems to be obsessed over &quot;large rats&quot; and &quot;stray dogs howling&quot;, they could be perceiving spirits, although ghost animals are not unheard of. Since we know how they think about this potential Mystery, if I was on site, I could filter for prominent sympathetic connections. With this combined approach, the mark can be found and we can have a convenient way to know how their situation is developing.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mekhaine places a scone on his plate. The jam filling seems to be less sweet and fruity, pairing well with some light clotted cream and the rich flavor of the pasty.<br /> <br /> &quot;The other subject is in the Tatcher Academy, they seem to be &quot;seeing radio signals&quot; and &quot;having strange daydreams&quot;. Usually schools have an almost non-existent cyber security, but with the right recommendation, they could be convinced to hire a security consultant and then a similar monitoring system could be installed. Not to mention that the signals themselves might be worth investigating.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-10-2024, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T22:06:24-07:00","id":1534180,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't worry about the closing hour, love,&quot; Thomas, less Berith, eased. &quot;I think they'll be keeping the doors open for just a bit longer for me. &quot;Thomas Haytham, with the Burrough Council. Maybe we could help eachother find what we need, yeah?&quot;<br /> <br /> Thomas glanced to Mother Time, a mixture of portrayed ease and discomfort as he studied her reaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","user":"VictorOfNyke","date":". 04-14-2024, 07:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-14T06:52:13-07:00","id":1534190,"title":"","content":"Jack jogs to the door of the Southwood archives, wincing as he checks the time. Just after seven, he's cutting it close. Sure, Trish had just asked that he come get her before the archives closed, but he'd intended to arrive with enough time to help her if she'd hit a dead end.<br /> <br /> As he reaches to open the door, the Mastigos once again checks the <u>\u200b\u200b\u200bMutable Mask</u> he's thrown over himself. It should last for the rest of the night, a few hours at least. A more bland and forgettable version of his natural face, it's somewhat unsettling how natural it now feels to wear a separate face when not acting as a Mage. He'd almost prefer to be Kusha right now, but Trish only knows Jack Bron, the helpful councilor from the Wellness Center.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good evening sir!&quot; Jack smiles at the clerk, doing his best to inject affability into his body language. End of shift is a miserable time for last-minute customers, best to get off on a good foot. &quot;I promise I'm not here to make your evening longer, I'm just picking up a friend so she doesn't have to walk alone in the dark.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glances down at the log book, noting the time Trish signed in. Almost four hours, hopefully she's made some headway with her project. &quot;Will you need me to sign in? I hope to be popping back out in just a minute or two.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-14T23:49:24-07:00","id":1534228,"title":"","content":"The ancient clerk sighs deeply. &quot;Yes sir. Just there.&quot;<br /> <br /> You see the other two names as well. &quot;Bridgett Timothy&quot; and &quot;Thomas Heytham&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-15-2024, 02:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-16T21:03:24-07:00","id":1534321,"title":"","content":"Jack winces, uncapping his pen and scrawling his name enough to hopefully be illegible. Maybe he <i>should</i> have invested in a fake identity when he moved to London, like the Guardians always pushed for, but it was too late for regrets now.<br /> <br /> &quot;Heytham? Ouch, I guess the boss is keeping you late. Like I said, I'll try to get out of your hair as quickly as possible.&quot;<br /> <br /> Entering the archive, Jack pauses at the sight of Trish, Principle Timothy, and Councilman Heytham. Trish seems calm, but best to be safe - pointing at the three with his pen, Jack casts two spells in quick succession","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-17T04:57:52-07:00","id":1534336,"title":"","content":"Principle TImothy looks like she is packing up to leave. She exchanges a glance with the councilman before she leaves. Even without magic, Kusha is able to notice a certain relief of tension in Trish as the headmistress leaves. Knowing a little of Trish's background, it is not surprising that she felt the need to &quot;perform&quot; for the school administrator - especially one with Ms. Timothy's reputation - &quot;The tallest poppy gets cut down.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-17-2024, 08:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-18T20:29:04-07:00","id":1534429,"title":"","content":"Salil arches a well-groomed eyebrow. &quot;Ghost rats, you say? Would you mind terribly if I tagged along? I'd like to see the commotion for myself.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T10:49:58-07:00","id":1534449,"title":"","content":"&quot;I welcome it, and I have already located a promising lead: One Jack Bron has been searching through online blogs and tabloids for stories of encounters with the supernatural. He has not looked up the rats yet, but since its a Mystery in his neighborhood, he might be investigating by word of mouth. Does that name ring any bells ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T00:17:11-07:00","id":1534481,"title":"","content":"Thomas straightened from his position, previously looming over notes he'd been exchanging with Trish. His thumb and index twisted his ring as his vision settled on the newcomer in the Prelate's departure. <br /> <br /> The imago built simply. Despite being of the Psycopomp's domain, there was <i>value</i>in that intangible thing called a soul. Berith, Baalberith, would take stock of it as the Lady of Numbers, the chancellor allowed him to do. This devil smiled kindly at Kusha before answering his arrival as he sussed out the symbols.<br /> <br /> &quot;My, it's busy here today,&quot; Thomas declared wryly. &quot;You've been awfully charming company, Trish. Dare I say, I'd bear mind my P's and Q's if there are journalists with your acumen running around now\u2013 It seems we have more company, evening, sir.&quot;<br /> <br /> Whether that smile was knowing, or very welcoming was hard to say.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-21T05:39:28-07:00","id":1534520,"title":"","content":"Trish's lack of fear or wariness eases Jack's apprehension, but does not erase it. His recent work with victims of kidnapping and abuse has left him distrustful of situations taken at face value, and of how different individuals have different interpretations of the same scene. <br /> <br /> Mr. Haytham's emotional state is at least not overly concerning - possibly attracted to Trish, but nothing overtly a threat to her. Jack takes a step into the room...<br /> <br /> And almost stumbles as his Periphery pings. A momentary sense of absence washes over him, like his sense of touch was briefly numbed. Jack tries to cover the hitch, but the faint jerk of his head towards Haytham likely gives him away - Trish certainly wasn't Awakened yesterday, so there are only so many suspects in sight.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good evening to you as well... Councilman? I hope I'm not interrupting anything, I'm just here to pick up my friend.&quot; Jack turns slightly to Trish, never letting Haytham out of his line of sight. &quot;Make any headway Trish? I can pitch in if you need an extra pair of hands.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>I really need to pick up the basics of Prime! If Haytham is a Mage, I just thoroughly gave myself away</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-23T07:37:31-07:00","id":1534591,"title":"","content":"Trish's eyes dart up to the wall clock in surprise. It's about half past 7.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh. Jack! I completely forgot! I'm sorry. Tommy and I...&quot; she glances over at Haytham, &quot;er, Councilman Haytham and I were just so busy working on this stuff for Jo.&quot; She looks down at all the papers and starts taking cell phone shots of the ones she hadn't already documented and then begins putting them back in their proper file folders. She then slips her phone back into her pocket.<br /> <br /> She seems to have noticed Jack's faint head Jerk, and his cageyness toward Haytham.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm going to go&quot; she says speaking to Thomas, &quot;I've been here all afternoon. And I don't want to keep Giles up all night, the dear old man. I think I have enough to take to my editors. Surely they'll let me write the story now. There's something strange going on in Walworth.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Jack was going to walk me over to my flat. There's a bar in the building and we were probably going to visit for a little bit&quot; (When she says &quot;visit for a little bit&quot;, a slight Texan drawl enters into her accent.) &quot;Did you want to come over? You can meet Jo. She should be getting off work soon. She works there at the restaurant. One of your constituents I suppose.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-24T20:55:45-07:00","id":1534678,"title":"","content":"Thomas weighed the suggestion a bit, his head rolling from left to right like two plates hung from either ear for his head to weigh. A slightly coy smile took his face, the councilman answering in a pleasant tone, &quot;Oh, I suppose it couldn't do any harm.&quot; He straightened his tie, shrugged off his coat, and hung it off his arm as he moved to open the door for the others.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you'd have me, then I'd love to come,&quot; He seemed relaxed, curious, and continued with an extended hand, &quot;Its good to meet you Jack, don't mind if I tag along?&quot; <i>Though it was said with the confidence of an 'of course you don't, right?</i> Thomas was slowly putting up red-twine between the mage Jack and oddity-maybe fox-ridder Trish in his head. It was hard to say if it was the charm, or the looming Mystery over her head... but he had certainly been lead to an interesting figure. He'd have to weather at that Mystery sooner rather than later. It was certain to nag him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T10:32:31-07:00","id":1534701,"title":"","content":"Jack hesitates only long enough to invoke an <u>Alter Mental Pattern</u> spell on himself, tracing the rune of Mind-Veiling on his leg with his capped pen. If he's going to be lying through his teeth all night, best to be competent at it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, as long as the Councilman doesn't mind drinking with us plebians&quot; His handshake is firm, just short of brisk. Naive confidence, a friendly, nonchalant air. A casual observer might assume he was intimidated by meeting the politician, and was now trying to cover that up<br /> <br /> <i>Damndamndamn gotta raise a Mental Shield as soon as he isn't looking. Watch this turn out to just be a Consillium member I haven't met yet - we'll laugh over how poorly prepared I am relative to my paranoia</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-25-2024, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T11:35:21-07:00","id":1534709,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fantastic! Let's go!&quot;<br /> <br /> Trish seems to alter her mood slightly, like she has been holding herself back a little but is now shifting into a more free and adventurous mood and throwing caution away.<br /> <br /> She says to good bye to the old clerk, Giles, and askes about his health and family. He seems to be friendly with Trish even though they probably only met today. He also seems a little bit relived to be able to close up for the night.<br /> <br /> Jack, Thomas, and Trish walk along the wet, cold winter streets. Trish walks quickly, taking long strides, and seems to be in a cheerful mood. The Spire looms large over South London, the towering pyramid growing larger and more menacing as they approach. Kusha and Berith can both feel the immense magical energy coming from the building, and marvel at what it must have cost the Ministry of Mammon to build such an obviously symbolic structure in the heart of the city. Both Jack and Thomas feel a little taken aback that Trish <i>lives</i> in this building, and seems so casual about it.<br /> <br /> A door man outside gestures them away from the entrance, but Trish greets him warmly by name, Nigel, and the three enter. The interior is a lavish ultra modern design with rich red carpet, multi storied glass windows and wooden paneling, and large crystal chandeliers hanging from the cavernous ceiling. There is a welcome desk and a very tall Sikh man with a neatly groomed beard and long mustache wearing a Dastar. He might be able to give Jack lessons in ominous looming, but seems to warm slightly as Trish approaches.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good Evening Ms. Takehashi. <i>Konbanwa</i>.&quot; he says in a deep, courteous sounding voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Salama </i>Mr. Singh. <i>Mokarimakka</i>?<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Bochi-bochi denna. </i>Will the lady be turning in for the evening?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;No way! The night is young, Mr. Singh. Is the restaurant still open?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes of course, my lady. Mr. Salil and a business partner are up there now. Will these two&quot; gesturing with his eyes to Jack and Thomas &quot;be joining you as guests?&quot;. As he glares down at them, they both feel their unseen senses awaken, and Kusha feels the assault of someone trying to scan his mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-25-2024, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T13:12:48-07:00","id":1534723,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course. This is Jack, he's an old friend. And this is Mr. Thomas Heytham. He's on the Southwark Borough Council. Very important person.&quot; Trish seems to be completely oblivious to the mental anguish Mr. Singh inflicted on her companions.<br /> <br /> &quot;Very well then my lady,&quot; Mr. Singh says stiffly, &quot;The new security systems are not all in place yet. I'll need you to sign them in here.&quot; He offers a log book and pen. Trish looks over at Jack and Thomas with a knowing look and then scribbles something in the book that doesn't look legible. Very different from the neat penmanship she used in the archive. Mr. Singh frowns, and Trish gives him her best smile. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yes. Well. Enjoy your evening Ms. Takehashi.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You as well Mr. Singh. Thank you so much!&quot;<br /> <br /> Trish leads Jack and Thomas to the elevators and uses a keycard to call a car. The elevator is very fast and creates a feeling of gravity growing heavier while at the same time the whooshing skyline through the glass almost induces vertigo.<br /> <br /> The restaurant of the Periya Vellai hotel sits high above the sparkling lights of the city. The Tower Bridge and the London Eye are visible through the windows. They sky is clear and the shadowy circle of the New Moon is dimly visible. The Maitre D' greets Trish by name and she asks to go to the bar. There a bar tender is mixing drinks. Farther along the bar, there is an older Japanese man arranging wine bottles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey Remy. <i>Domo Ojisan. </i>Is Jo still here?&quot; The older man waves hello and the bartender answers.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey Love. She's in the back, clocking out. She'll be out in a bit. I'll let her know you are here.&quot;<br /> <br /> Trish makes her way through the restaurant. It is not crowded as the Hotel is not fully open to the public yet, and everyone seems to know Trish.<br /> <br /> They arrive at a table where a hansom Jordanian business man in a very expensive suit and a Greek man are finishing a meal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-26T22:51:38-07:00","id":1534797,"title":"","content":"Thomas felt a hint of rigidity spreading from his shoulders. The whole meeting felt like it was being built on suspicious grounds. He couldn't confirm it, but the way things were lining up felt so <i>ordained. </i>Was it tied to her Mystery? What was it that owned her soul? The mamonite's fingers trail to his ring while his thoughts raced before he settled his gaze on the men. His attention, lingered perhaps on the long side... trying to place the exact recognition again. Another servant of Mammon? <br /> <br /> Thomas smiled, an expression that was practiced to touch the eyes, he offered a hand to the men. &quot;Friends of Ms. Takehashi, I take it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T19:17:13-07:00","id":1534829,"title":"","content":"Jack's hair is already standing on end - he has recognized <i>no one</i> so far, and has been magically scanned at least twice in less than an hour. Even before Awakening, this would not be somewhere he frequented, and these were <i>not</i> the kind of people he normally rubbed shoulders with. Hoping his Veils can see him through the night, the Arrow elects to allow the Councilman to take the lead. A confident smile and a polite nod, but otherwise just try to blend into the background, looming quietly","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:09:12-07:00","id":1534832,"title":"","content":"Post Deleted","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:13:11-07:00","id":1534836,"title":"","content":"Salil stands up from his chair and gives a slight but sincere-looking bow to Trish. &quot;Good evening, Ms. Takahasi. You're looking radiant as always.&quot;<br /> <br /> He casts his eyes on her companions. &quot;Councilman, it is a pleasure to see you. You have wonderful taste in company.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T14:20:45-07:00","id":1534861,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;</i>Takehashi<i>? Trish </i>Takehashi<i>? Why are you here ? You investigate Mysteries, yet you publicize your findings. I deflect attention away from you and yet you show up here, with a servant of Mammon in tow. What is your value, miss </i>Takehashi? <i>Are you an Awakened yourself ? </i>&quot;<br /> <br /> Mekhane had chosen his attire with precision for his tasks. Just formal enough to make a good impression in the Spire, but also make it so changing to a light jacket would make him blend in seamlessly in the street. But this deviated from his predictions, collecting more information under these circumstances would require subtlety. Mekhane started his calculations.<br /> <br /> Alexis gets up to greet the new arrivals and makes a carefully calculated motion to &quot;not forget&quot; the sunglasses on the table. Utilizing his Supernal user interface, he carefully constructs a profile within the expected thaumic values for a Sleeper. He takes his glasses in hand, a finger carefully obscuring the inner rune for <i>Knowledge</i>, its embedded subroutines automatically optimizing the Imago's code and reducing bugs. He places the glasses on his business shirt's pocket and the top lens projects the data profile onto him. He quickly sets up a temporary server for the Imago, a tiring process, but one that frees up precious CPU cycles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good evening, councilman, its a pleasure to meet you. Alexis Levidis, digital security consultant&quot;. He turns to greet the other two, quickly accessing his real time image processing software. Normally all the algorithm needed some minor adjustments on the field, but the implant had already optimized the code for two of them, allowing Mekhane to deploy Prime Sight with maximum efficiency. A stream of data floods his senses, as the UI overlay starts highlighting the multiple data streams of High Speech coursing through everything, mana charges visible in most of the people attending.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Hmm, no mana in your Pattern, you probably aren't an Awakened. What a pity, so why all the fuzz ? Who are you ?&quot;</i> he catches a glimpse of some mana near her <i>&quot;But you are ! Maybe you are my client ? If that is the case, I can't risk exposing you, it would be unprofessional. But you may also be who my client is trying to hide her from, hmm.....more data is required&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Its a pleasure to make your acquaintance Mrs Takehashi, and the gentleman accompanying you as well&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-28-2024, 05:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T22:11:42-07:00","id":1534982,"title":"","content":"Mekhane fabricates an Imago in the shape of a new implant, an ocular augmentation that can produce Prime wireframes of designated subjects. The augmentation slots into his eyes seamlessly and he focuses on the man next to Trish. It scans his Prime data and creates a manipulatable projection, the intuitive interface responding to his design, starting to take apart the living Supernal machine, layer by layer. He isolates the operating software and examines the power source.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Seems he is as new to being an Awakened as me, a promising recruit, perhaps ? Bringing another Awakened into the Chancellor's pocket would certainly be a prestigious accomplishment, but first thing is first&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He focuses back on Trish. The augment begins to reverse engineer her Prime wireframe. The software is buggy, messy, but showing clear sparks of genius in its architecture. The user interface is unintuitive, but she somehow is able to make it work when needed, although that is a credit to her rather than the UX designer.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Fascinating, what an unusual ability. She is not a Proximi, perhaps that is related to why my client wants to keep her ability under wraps ? Hmm, I wonder how much Berith knows, let's see how this plays out&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 05-01-2024, 02:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-02T06:45:14-07:00","id":1535061,"title":"","content":"Trish notices Jack's discomfort with the situation and gives him a look of sympathy, and then looks over at Alexis, noticing the look that he gave towards Jack.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is my friend, Jack Bron. He's a very important part of the Walworth community. He's the head of the Mental Health Clinic there.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>That's odd. What does he need the sunglasses for? What a strange man.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Oh. So you two do know each other!,&quot; referring to Saulil and Thomas, &quot;Wonderful! Tom and I were in the library all day, and I think we've made a breakthrough. I can't stay long. I want to talk to Jo about what we found, and then write a draft for my editors. Tom, you and Jack can fill Salil and ... Alexis in on what's going on, can't you?&quot;<br /> <br /> After making some more polite small talk Trish wanders off in search of Joanna.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-02-2024, 10:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-05T12:24:45-07:00","id":1535181,"title":"","content":"&quot;Please, it seems I'm hardly the only one with delightful taste,&quot; Thomas stated with measured pleasure to Salil before turning his attention to his companion. &quot;The pleasure is mine, Mr. Levidis. Mind if we join you, gentleman? It seems to me there is some to discuss.&quot;<br /> <br /> He didn't wait for the answer, Berith's hands caught the back of a couple of free chairs. He'd pull one to his right for his newfound compatriot, Jack, and claimed the other with an amused expression.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-07T19:49:20-07:00","id":1535244,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, indeed. Our friend here,&quot; Salil gestures to Mekhaine, &quot;was informing me of some possibly supernatural goings-on at the Walworth Estates and I had the idea of employing this to our advantage. Such abnormal conditions, if nudged in the right direction, could lower the long-term viability of the Estates and help persuade some of the more near-sighted members of the Burrough Council that the project is not worth preserving.&quot;<br /> <br /> Salil looks toward Mekhaine. &quot;You offered your services before. Would you be able to help us locate these disturbances?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-08T09:41:30-07:00","id":1535279,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So this is Jack Bron, arrived just as we were discussing him, what suspiciously perfect timing. Berith did not introduce him after I cast that spell, which means that if he was his new protege, Saulin's implicit assent to it would cue him to introduce his Shadow Name. Which means either he is a new recruit on a job interview, or Berith is overseeing his mission for someone else. Either outcome could have pressured him to stay, so Saulin framed the situation so that he is tempted to share his data either way. Maybe I can leverage it to get a better read on his skills, lets lay the groundwork to lower the pressure.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed I can, as of late, there have been many reports of mysteriously encounters with large rats and howling stray dogs, I believe that is a promising lead. What are your thoughts on this, Mr Bron ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-09T08:33:38-07:00","id":1535351,"title":"","content":"Jack sits, grimacing slightly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Rats and dogs? Can't say I care much for either. I can see the appeal, I guess, and as long as the owner is grooming and training them properly it's none of my buisness.&quot; He indicates a short, faded scar on the back of his hand. &quot;I've been bitten by 'friendly' dogs before, and I've refused to dog-sit since. If there are strays around, I'll keep a wary eye on them.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 05-22-2024, 11:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-14T21:59:15-07:00","id":1535610,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fortunately for you, Mr. Bron, it is the rats that primarily interest me. I too am not a fan of wild dogs and I suggest that we steer clear of any if possible. The rats are either a purely mundane infestation or a sign that something potent is brewing on the other side of the veil. Either possibility can be used to our advantage.&quot;<br /> <br /> Salil leaned back in his chair. &quot;By the way, gentlemen, please feel free to order something. The night is on me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T12:35:43-07:00","id":1535662,"title":"","content":"Mekhane takes a seat at the table and starts focusing on Jack, drawing on his own authority over knowledge to access his psychographic profile. Countless pixels of data emerge from Jack's mind, each one containing a significant event, orbiting his head in a sphere of small screens. He builds an Imago to parse through them all, then with one of the hands he has under the table, he starts taking notes, like writing down lookup references in a library. The data starts to condense into an implant above Jack's amygdala, the pixels falling into place to form a microchip. Its form reminds him of depictions of Baghdad's House of Wisdom, but its design far more optimized, every building and street contributing to the overall efficiency of the infrastructure.<br /> <br /> The microchip comes to life, the circuitry of the grand library responding to his lookup request, projecting streams of matching results into his eyes. He first received data on the one responsible for Jack in the Order, the name Emma Cottle being returned, the head of the medical clinic, his profile indicating powerful paranoia, sadness and ....a sense Jack knows where her body is. The profiler then examines his connection to Trish, defined by a firm sense of duty.<br /> <br /> Amidst the data streams, certain factoids draw his eye. Taken independently, they would mean nothing, but Mekhane senses that when put together at the right time, they would undeniably lead to great opportunities. He commits them to memory, sensing the hand of the Chancellor at work.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;A mage with medical connections, not one I am familiar with, I will need to ask around later. You certainly are not Nameless. What posed such a threat that it managed to kill her and make you want to hide the evidence ? We will see...</i>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T12:35:43-07:00","id":1535663,"title":"","content":"&lt;duplicated post&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T23:44:39-07:00","id":1535973,"title":"","content":"Thomas obliged to Salil's offer, ordering a glass of gin and a tea bag. He'd drop the pouch in and let it steep in the spirit. Berith leaned forward, letting himself dangle precariously between his Perosna and his sleeper self, little overlaps in their personalities. &quot;If we're playing with our cards on the table, then maybe I should share what I uncovered with Miss Takehashi,&quot; Berith seemed relaxed as he gently bounced the teabag in his drink. &quot;There are a number of... curious discrepancies tied to the Walworth estate. Namely, missing money, a few missing persons, and a report of the structural stability of the flats being... curiously lacking in some pages. I couldn't in good conscience allow my fellow councilmen vote positively on something so...improperly managed.&quot;<br /> <br /> Thomas finally took his drink and knocked back some of its contents before asking, &quot;I think you understand my implication, yes?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T06:23:15-07:00","id":1535985,"title":"","content":"Caerus, and he thinks of himself as Caerus more and more, and less of \u00c9douard every day; is in his room doing his daily rutine of checking what the future holds. His master was adamant that one of the strenghts of this path was foresight and preparation, so as usual he checks no one is around home, locks windows and door of the room, brings up his lucky coin (a gift from Tyche, described as a very special coin) and starts chanting in High Speech while puting a lot of mental effort in this casting, trying to get more concrete answers.<br /> <br /> As usual, he checks what is in his own future at least for this day asking &quot;<i>Am I in danger today from something?</i>&quot; and not for the first time &quot;<i>Will I find Tyche?</i>&quot;.<br /> <br /> Depending on what he sees, he will keep casting questions about himself and how he could interact with others: Tyche, Joanna, the Gang, his mum, and his cat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-20-2024, 08:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T15:43:25-07:00","id":1536007,"title":"","content":"Despite the closed window and door, Caerus feels a swirl of air move around him and smells the ozone scent of an electrical storm. The air moving past his ears seems to carry whispers, some from voices he recognizes, Tyche, his Mum, Joanna, the Artful Club, and people from the neighborhood. Some are from voices he does not recognize. He hears Joanna cry out in pain &quot;Oh God, Sh--, Sh--, Sh--&quot; the sounds of something snapping and popping and ripping apart, &quot;What the F---?&quot; What is happening to me?&quot; He hears another woman's voice gasp and say something in a language he doesn't understand, and he hears his own voice say ,&quot;Jo, wait! Stop!&quot;. Tyche whispers, &quot;Yes.&quot; Then she says, &quot;In time, sweet boy, in Time. Help my handmaiden, and you will see me in Time.&quot;<br /> <br /> Caerus feels the swirling air settle in his room. Dust drifts down. Some papers from his desk shuffle. He looks and sees a scrap of paper that he forgot about laying on top. It's a name &quot;Trish&quot; and a phone number and address.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T16:15:04-07:00","id":1536010,"title":"","content":"Mekhane's hands are steepled on the table, his posture straight and relaxed, pensive.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Being able to seize control of Walsworth is too big a prize not to pursue, which means the article may need to be buried. But I am not certain of why Jack feels dutybound to Trish, so I must be careful not to trigger the Streisand effect. Simultaneously, I must not reveal our full hand before I know where his allengance lies. Trish mentioned editors, so now it won't be seen as odd that I know she is a journalist.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I take your meaning. the biggest constraint is when the article on the investigation will be published. But alongside it comes an opportunity, a favorable resolution could garner more votes. Were these discrepancies more frequent near any specific block or building ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Perhaps this is linked to how Emma Cottle disappeared, if this all happened near the clinic, its possible Jack may know more.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T17:52:40-07:00","id":1536017,"title":"","content":"Worried to hear what seems a very dangerous experience, and forgetting Tyche for more immediate concerns Caerus starts formulating a plan: first cast a couple more spells to get information on today's danger to himself, and then go to check this &quot;Trish&quot;, calling to meet her, and if he gets no answer going to her place to wait for her.<br /> <br /> He follows a similar procedure as before, chanting and exerting his will, focusing on more precise answers, all this to ask <i>&quot;Can I save myself from today's danger?&quot;,</i><i>&quot;Can I save Jo from today's danger?&quot;</i>,<i> &quot;Can I do anything to benefit from this danger?&quot;</i>, and <i>&quot;Will killing this &quot;Trish&quot; stop today's danger?</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> After a brief reflection, Caerus considers that &quot;Trish&quot; could be very well a path to Tyche, he quickly casts another <i>Divination</i>, to findout <i>&quot;Is this &quot;Trish&quot; my ticket to finding Tyche?&quot;</i> and<i> &quot;Is the third woman from the vision this &quot;Trish&quot;?\u200b&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Then it comes how to profit from today's danger, two Serendipity spells cast in succession, the first with the goal <i>&quot;Survive today's danger while benefiting&quot;</i> and the second with <i>&quot;Help Jo&quot; </i>as a goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-21-2024, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T05:20:51-07:00","id":1536094,"title":"","content":"The air around Caerus' ears again fills with whispers and rumors, hundreds of voices talking all at once like in a crowded place. As his imago comes into sharper focus a few voices become louder and clearer.<br /> <br /> He hears Jo, &quot;Where the f--- is Eddie? He was supposed to meet me after work. Did he just decide to bugger off?&quot;<br /> Then he hears the voice of the woman who was speaking in another language before, but this time she is speaking in English with a very posh accent, &quot;Well maybe Jack could walk with you, or Saulil could order an Uber.&quot;<br /> &quot;F--- this. F---Eddie. I'll just walk home myself.&quot;<br /> &quot;I'm really worried about you. Your not like yourself tonight.&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes I am. This is how I am. All the time. F--- off Trish. You're not my mum. Stop trying to &quot;save&quot; me.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Caerus hears two low whispers which he doesn't recognize. &quot;Someone with her, um, instincts, could be very useful to the ministry, for, um, 'wet work'.&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes, but how would we keep her from joining one of their, um, 'packs' do they call them?&quot;<br /> &quot;Maybe the boy could help. And the doctor and reporter. She trusts them. If we could turn her against her own kind, that would... be something.&quot; <br /> <br /> Then one of his mates from the Artfuls, &quot;Holy Sh-- man! I've never seen anything like that. How did she survive that? One in a million chance. What the hell?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T06:03:51-07:00","id":1536095,"title":"","content":"Caerus casts again, letting the silver coin spin around and around. He feels exhausted by the strain of his willpower, but keeps going. He can't give up.<br /> <br /> He looks at the scrap of paper. Who is &quot;Trish&quot;. Where did this note even come from? Did Jo give it to him, or someone else? He struggles to remember.<br /> <br /> Caerus hears the voice of Tyche, &quot;No its not just the awakened. There are many sources of magic besides the grace of the exarchs. Though they reign supreme over all. You will understand in time. The realm of Arcadia is a vast domain.&quot; He thinks about Tyche. There's something about her voice that reminds him of the posh woman Jo said was Trish.<br /> <br /> He takes his phone and looks up the address on the paper. Its that mega skyscraper. The Spike or something like that. It's where Jo's new job is, she's working as a waitress or something. He chuckles at the idea of Jo being a waitress. They better be nice to her, or she'd spit in their food. Hopefully the tips are good. He looks at out the window and sees the giant thing in the distance. You can't avoid looking at it, now matter where you go in London now. It's always looming in the background. It looks like a...wait, didn't Tyche say something once about a Pyramid. Like an Iron Pyramid. That's how she described the ladder to get to the Exarchs. Is this all connected some how?<br /> <br /> The burning desire to climb that ladder fills Caerus mind. All that power. &quot;All the kingdoms of this world I will give you, if you bow down and worship me.&quot; That's something Mum says in church sometimes. But there is no god. There are only the Exarchs.<br /> <br /> He feels the winds of Fate blowing in the direction of that building. &quot;Trish&quot; lives there. Jo works there. It's gotta be the place. His ladder to the throne.<br /> <br /> But what about Jo? Is there a way to help her. Whatever is going to happen, it sounds bad. There's something about this time of the month. No, not like that! Something...un-natural.<br /> <br /> For some reason he thinks about the flat building where her Gram lives. Jo has these fits sometimes, like her nose starts bleeding and her head hurts so much she can't stand up. Migraines. She says it has something to do with rats in the basement. She tried to go down there one time and got so sick that that psych doctor over at the clinic had to take her to the hospital. Wait, did &quot;Trish&quot; mention something about Jack when she was talking to Jo. Isn't that the doctors name? He's a Manc who just moved to London or something. The one that got Jo into running before she joined the Artfuls. Yeah. He showed up around the same time other doctor went missing. The nice one everyone in the neighborhood liked.<br /> <br /> Maybe he should check the basement out. Or find the psych doc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T13:54:13-07:00","id":1536115,"title":"","content":"Caerus takes the tube from Walworth to the South Bank near Tower Bridge. As he gets above ground he senses intense supernal power radiating from the looming skyscraper that is his goal. Its windy and there is icy rain coming down as he makes his way to the building. A door man in a warm coat and hat waits outside the main entrance. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oi. Kid. It's closed. Move along.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T20:48:52-07:00","id":1536137,"title":"","content":"Caerus takes the scrap of paper out of his pocket. The handwriting is very neat and tidy. Like a school teachers. He heaves a sigh, and dials the number. He hears a distant roll of faint thunder and smells ozone, indicating that his peripheral mage sight catches some magical effect. The phone call picks up. He quickly blurts out a bunch of incoherent nonsense of about Jo, and being worried about her, and rats in her Gran's building. Fortunately, somewhere in there he has the presence of mind to mention his name.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh hello! Edouard is it? From Jo's parkour videos. Um, sure. I don't have long to chat. I'm going over to the housing archives to look for maintenance records. Yeah, if you have information on the rats, I'd love to hear it for my story. And, um, I'm a bit worried about Jo myself. I'll have Nigel and Mr. Singh let you up, and you can meet me in the restaurant. Can you hand the phone over to Nigel?&quot;<br /> <br /> Caerus hands the phone over to the doorman who listens to Trish for a minute, seeming a little surprised, and still eyeing Edouard with suspicion. &quot;Yes, well it is unusual, but if you vouch for him.&quot; He hands the phone back to Caerus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T21:48:11-07:00","id":1536142,"title":"","content":"Saulin sets his cup down, closes his eyes for a moment, and sighs. &quot;Structural integrity issues work to our advantage. Missing persons and cover-ups, if discovered, do not. If the police get too heavily involved, it could actually slow down any development plans. It's too early to tell but we may have to support this intentional obfuscation. The immediate task, however, is information gathering. We need to know what is happening at the Estates.&quot; He steeples his hands on the table. &quot;Friends, are you up for a field trip?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-24T23:49:33-07:00","id":1536233,"title":"","content":"Earlier in the day, around noon...<br /> <br /> The doorman let's Caerus into the lobby of the massive skyscraper, the Spire. The carpet inside is a rich red and there is high two story glass windows and wood paneling. There are crystal chandeliers high above. This place vibes of more money than Edouard ever thought existed.<br /> <br /> A huge like 2m tall Indian dude in a turban and expensive suit shows him over to the lift. The lift is really fast, like a rocket, and the world below looks like it's getting smaller and smaller through the windows as Caerus ascends. <br /> <br /> He's shown into the restaurant which again just smells like millions of pounds sterling. Everything looks like it's made out of silver and gold and crystal. He looks out at the windows that surround the dining area and it looks like he's on top of the world, looking down at London like he owns the whole city.<br /> <br /> There are two old dudes at the bar, one of them looks Irish, the other one is East Asian or something. Near the bar, sitting at a table is a woman reading a newspaper.<br /> <br /> She looks up and smiles. The expression &quot;knockout&quot; does not even begin to describe the raw beauty and charisma of this woman. She is also Asian, and looks to be in her early twenties, five or six years older than Edouard. She is casually dressed in clothes that don't have flashy labels but look <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quiet_luxury?wprov=sfla1\" target=\"_blank\">expensive</a>.<br /> <br /> As she stands up to greet Edouard he notices that she is slightly taller than him even though she is wearing flat shoes, about 1.74 m.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello Edouard. I&quot;m Trish. Trish Takehashi. Please have a seat.&quot; If you looked up Posh in the dictionary this woman's photo would be next to the definition. Like in the gossip magazines they are always showing you what celebrities look like when they don't have makeup on and are just going to the shop, and they look like ordinary people. This is the opposite. Being near this woman makes him feel like he's left reality and is inside a movie now.<br /> <br /> &quot;What did you want to talk about? You said you think Jo is in some sort of trouble?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T18:46:38-07:00","id":1536324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1536142#post1536142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saulin sets his cup down, closes his eyes for a moment, and sighs. &quot;Structural integrity issues work to our advantage. Missing persons and cover-ups, if discovered, do not. If the police get too heavily involved, it could actually slow down any development plans. It's too early to tell but we may have to support this intentional obfuscation. The immediate task, however, is information gathering. We need to know what is happening at the Estates.&quot; He steeples his hands on the table. &quot;Friends, are you up for a field trip?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I... can't say I'm on the same page as you, gentlemen, but I'm aware of at least two low-profile potential disappearances in the area. I imagine it would be good PR for your office if that was resolved through direct intervention, Councilman?&quot; He glances at Berith, before warily meeting Saulin's eyes. &quot;I suppose I'm up for a field trip, as long as I'll be back for my afternoon shift.&quot;<br /> <br /> A self-depricating grin tugs at the corner of Kusha's lips &quot;Assuming I was included in that invitation, anyway&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T11:41:14-07:00","id":1536373,"title":"","content":"Earlier in the day...<br /> <br /> Trish begins to take notes in a small booklet while Edouard talks, and talks. She furrows her brow a little at the mention of New Moon productions.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not, uh...familiar with that production company. I could look into it. I guess i do have some connections to the, um, film industry. My friend Saulil has many business connections. This is actually &quot;his&quot; building,&quot; she looks around at her surroundings, &quot;...sort of.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe he could help. He's often looking for promising talent. Maybe you could apply to be an intern in his Real Estate development company. It sounds like based on your school performance, and your work ethic and entrepreneurial spirit, you will have a bright future. It would certainly be a crime to let your talents go to waste.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's hard for Edouard to tell, but maybe there was a hint of a smirk on Trish's face as she said this last bit.<br /> <br /> &quot;I think with Jo...well we will see. I'm glad she's on this fitness routine. I think it will help with her health problems. Jack knows more about that then I do. And if she can hold down this job for awhile, and learn to get along with people a little. I do worry about her not sleeping much at home. Maybe there is something to be done about her housing situation. But you can only help someone as much as they want to be helped.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm planning on going over to the government archives in a little bit to do some research on the building maintenance in Jo's Gran's flat building. It seems like something is off there. And if there is some sort of mismanagement, my paper's readers will certainly want to know about it. The Borough Council and the housing authority must be held accountable to their constituents. Maybe I can arrange a meeting between you and Saulil before I go.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-27-2024, 03:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T21:15:36-07:00","id":1536400,"title":"","content":"&quot;OK. Great. I think he's in a meeting right now, but Saulil should be free in a little bit. You could go down to his office and wait for him&quot; Trish gives Edouard the office number and walks with him back to the lift. As they ride down, she seems distracted by her phone, and Caerus uses the opportunity to focus his active mage sight on her.<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe I'll see you later this evening. I think Jo and I were going to try and get together after her shift ends at the restaurant.&quot;<br /> <br /> Caerus gets off on one of the business floors below the hotel and goes to the office Trish indicated. There is a receptionist named Ahammed. He asks Edouard to wait until Mr. Amjad gets out of his meeting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T22:54:26-07:00","id":1536406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1536373#post1536373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Earlier in the day...<br /> <br /> Trish begins to take notes in a small booklet while Edouard talks, and talks. She furrows her brow a little at the mention of New Moon productions.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not, uh...familiar with that production company. I could look into it. I guess i do have some connections to the, um, film industry. My friend Saulil has many business connections. This is actually &quot;his&quot; building,&quot; she looks around at her surroundings, &quot;...sort of.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe he could help. He's often looking for promising talent. Maybe you could apply to be an intern in his Real Estate development company. It sounds like based on your school performance, and your work ethic and entrepreneurial spirit, you will have a bright future. It would certainly be a crime to let your talents go to waste.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's hard for Edouard to tell, but maybe there was a hint of a smirk on Trish's face as she said this last bit.<br /> <br /> &quot;I think with Jo...well we will see. I'm glad she's on this fitness routine. I think it will help with her health problems. Jack knows more about that then I do. And if she can hold down this job for awhile, and learn to get along with people a little. I do worry about her not sleeping much at home. Maybe there is something to be done about her housing situation. But you can only help someone as much as they want to be helped.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm planning on going over to the government archives in a little bit to do some research on the building maintenance in Jo's Gran's flat building. It seems like something is off there. And if there is some sort of mismanagement, my paper's readers will certainly want to know about it. The Borough Council and the housing authority must be held accountable to their constituents. Maybe I can arrange a meeting between you and Saulil before I go.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Caerus thinks he has achieved as much as he could with Trish on the &quot;Help Jo&quot; topic.<br /> <br /> He accepts Trish offering of meeting her posh friends, ASAP if feasible. But he is doing a mental note to cast something to findout if Trish was really making fun of him... Trish might be somewhat similar to Tyche, but she is NOT Tyche, he will accept lip from no one else, pretty or posh. If she was offending him, even as a slight joke, he will do something later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-28-2024, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T10:17:53-07:00","id":1536443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1536400#post1536400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;OK. Great. I think he's in a meeting right now, but Saulil should be free in a little bit. You could go down to his office and wait for him&quot; Trish gives Edouard the office number and walks with him back to the lift. As they ride down, she seems distracted by her phone, and<b> Caerus uses the opportunity to focus his active mage sight on her.</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe I'll see you later this evening. I think Jo and I were going to try and get together after her shift ends at the restaurant.&quot;<br /> <br /> Caerus gets off on one of the business floors below the hotel and goes to the office Trish indicated. There is a receptionist named Ahammed. He asks Edouard to wait until Mr. Amjad gets out of his meeting.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u00c9douard likes the sea, becoming Caerus did not change that, he likes the sea so much that when &quot;pre-taking&quot; exams with Time he always answers everything maritime related from his own memory as it is the only topic he truly relishes from school.<br /> <br /> He once saw a YouTube video about the underwater effects of earthquakes, some divers caugh during one, the force completely invisible except for the sudden effects on everything, imposible to hold on soil, rocks or to each other. A bit disturbing for a landlubber like Caerus, the image was burned in his memory.<br /> <br /> He feels the same watching Trish, with the slight difference that it is Fate and not Water what is about to move. And Trish is, or will be the center of it. As the submarine currents she has a path to follow, invisible to others, but that flow can take you with it if you get caught, in other words she has a <i>Destiny</i>, a strong one at that, and she is under an <i>Oath </i>do stuff. There are slight Time alterations around her, Caerus senses it as temperature fluctuations in the water, but the Fate factor is overwhelming his perception.<br /> <br /> Caerus stops using the Sight, and makes another mental note, to use his focused sight later on Trish, and to thread lightly when dealing with her, as he is not willing to get swept into her Fate-trail without knowning what it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-29-2024, 01:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T13:29:08-07:00","id":1536582,"title":"","content":"Caerus writes a message to Jo &quot;<i>About to hit it big, I am in the building you work. Do NOT leave without me, and if you do let me know where and with who you are going, I can go in detail in person</i>&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T21:44:30-07:00","id":1536604,"title":"","content":"Evening scene:<br /> <br /> Saulin nods politely at Kusha. &quot;Of course. The more the merrier.&quot;<br /> <br /> Afternoon scene:<br /> <br /> Eventually, the door to the office opens and three men dressed in business casual walk out. The receptionist informs Caerus that he can enter.<br /> <br /> From the oil paintings on the walls to the Thai rosewood desk, the office screams money. Saulin sits behind the desk on a leather chair that somehow reminds Caerus of a throne. Next to his laptop sits an immaculately maintained bonsai tree.<br /> <br /> Saulin looks up as Caerus enters, gives a polite smile, and gestures to a chair in front of the desk. &quot;Ah, you must be the friend Ms. Takehashi spoke of. Please sit down.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T13:49:04-07:00","id":1536713,"title":"","content":"Caerus feels pangs of regret due not analysing Trish with his other abilities. Even if she is some sort of Fate-maelstrom, other Arcana could reveal a lot of her next steps and what she is aiming for, and aid or hinder Caerus search for Tyche.<br /> <br /> Unwilling to make the same mistake again, he enters Saulil office eager and observant. He is rewarded by finding a symbol on one of those miniature trees rich guys like so much and he starts with his Mage Sight ready to fire.<br /> <br /> The tree is so interesting, it has been in contact with a powerful Destiny, but more importantly this tree is a time traveller! And one that is making him dizzy as everything seems to have happened already many times. That is something that is extremely interesting, thinking quick Caerus goes for a Mind rote: <i>Know Nature</i>, to learn what this Saulil guy is all about. He pushes hard since Mind is not his forte and goes for as much information he can pump out of this guy. Today he has glimpsed the top, and maybe here is where is starts his climb to the top.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 06-02-2024, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T18:54:17-07:00","id":1536726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1536604#post1536604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Evening scene:<br /> <br /> Saulin nods politely at Kusha. &quot;Of course. The more the merrier.&quot;<br /> <br /> Afternoon scene:<br /> <br /> Eventually, the door to the office opens and three men dressed in business casual walk out. The receptionist informs Caerus that he can enter.<br /> <br /> From the oil paintings on the walls to the Thai rosewood desk, the office screams money. Saulin sits behind the desk on a leather chair that somehow reminds Caerus of a throne. Next to his laptop sits an immaculately maintained bonsai tree.<br /> <br /> Saulin looks up as Caerus enters, gives a polite smile, and gestures to a chair in front of the desk. &quot;Ah, you must be the friend Ms. Takehashi spoke of. Please sit down.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Excellent. However, I require a few minutes to prepare. I set aside a different outfit for the investigation, as I believe my business attire would draw too much attention.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;A business casual look balances professionalism and approachability, making it the optimal choice to open more doors. The question is whether Saulin and Berith will want to be discrete. Jack's reputation could either help us blend in or make a greater impact, depending on how we play it.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-02-2024, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}